{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  carrinho — cart drawer lateral (mini-carrinho)
  ============================================================

  O QUE FAZ:
  Renderiza o carrinho lateral (drawer) da loja já com o estado atual do
  objeto `cart` do Shopify, direto do servidor. Ou seja: quando a página
  carrega, o drawer já vem com os itens, quantidades e subtotal corretos —
  o JavaScript só precisa abrir/fechar e atualizar depois das ações
  (melhoria progressiva).

  Contém:
  - overlay (fundo escurecido) que fecha o drawer ao clicar;
  - painel lateral com cabeçalho (título + botão fechar);
  - lista de itens com imagem, título, variante, preço, stepper de
    quantidade e botão remover;
  - estado vazio (aparece quando o carrinho não tem itens);
  - rodapé com subtotal e botão que leva à página oficial do carrinho.

  COMO USAR:
  {% render 'carrinho' %}
  Incluir uma única vez no layout (theme.liquid), dentro do <body>.
  Para abrir pelo header, o botão de carrinho em sections/nav.liquid usa
  [data-cart-drawer-open] (o href continua como fallback sem JS).

  PARÂMETROS:
  Nenhum — renderizado diretamente, lê o objeto global `cart`.

  GANCHOS PARA O JAVASCRIPT (data-attributes):
  - [data-cart-drawer]           painel do drawer (alvo do abrir/fechar)
  - [data-cart-drawer-open]      qualquer gatilho que abre o drawer
  - [data-cart-drawer-close]     botões que fecham o drawer
  - [data-cart-drawer-overlay]   fundo clicável que fecha o drawer
  - [data-cart-items]            container da lista de itens
  - [data-cart-line]             cada linha de item (valor = índice da linha)
  - [data-cart-line-key]         chave da linha (usar em /cart/change.js)
  - [data-cart-line-price]       preço daquela linha (re-render pontual)
  - [data-cart-qty-decrease]     botão "-" do stepper
  - [data-cart-qty-increase]     botão "+" do stepper
  - [data-cart-qty-input]        input de quantidade (data-line, data-variant-id)
  - [data-cart-remove]           botão remover item
  - [data-cart-empty]            bloco do estado vazio
  - [data-cart-footer]           rodapé (subtotal + finalizar)
  - [data-cart-subtotal]         texto do subtotal
  - [data-cart-count]            contador de itens (mesmo gancho do header)

  OBSERVAÇÕES:
  O botão "Finalizar compra" aponta de propósito para {{ routes.cart_url }}
  (página oficial do carrinho), não para o checkout direto: o drawer é só
  uma prévia, a compra acontece na página oficial.
  O bloco <style> está vazio de propósito — a estilização é feita depois.
  O CSS deve manter overlay e painel fechados por padrão (fora da tela) e
  abrir via classe de estado adicionada pelo JS.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div id="carrinho" class="cart-drawer-root">
  <!-- Fundo clicável: fecha o drawer -->
  <div class="cart-drawer__overlay" data-cart-drawer-overlay aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- Painel lateral -->
  <aside
    class="cart-drawer"
    data-cart-drawer
    id="cart-drawer"
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="true"
    aria-labelledby="cart-drawer-titulo"
    aria-hidden="true"
    tabindex="-1"
  >
    <!-- Cabeçalho -->
    <header class="cart-drawer__header">
      <h2 class="cart-drawer__title" id="cart-drawer-titulo">
        Sua base espacial
        <span class="cart-drawer__count" data-cart-count>{{ cart.item_count }}</span>
      </h2>

      <button type="button" class="cart-drawer__close" data-cart-drawer-close aria-label="Fechar carrinho">
        {% render 'icon', name: 'close' %}
      </button>
    </header>

    <!-- Corpo: lista de itens -->
    <div class="cart-drawer__body">
      <ul class="cart-drawer__items" data-cart-items role="list">
        {%- for item in cart.items -%}
          <li
            class="cart-drawer__item"
            data-cart-line="{{ forloop.index }}"
            data-cart-line-key="{{ item.key }}"
            data-variant-id="{{ item.variant_id }}"
            data-cart-unit-price="{{ item.price }}"
          >
            <a class="cart-drawer__item-image-link" href="{{ item.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
              {%- if item.image -%}
                <img
                  class="cart-drawer__item-image"
                  src="{{ item.image | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                  alt="{{ item.product.title | escape }}"
                  width="100"
                  height="100"
                  loading="lazy"
                >
              {%- else -%}
                <span class="cart-drawer__item-image cart-drawer__item-image--vazia">
                  {% render 'icon', name: 'bag' %}
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </a>

            <div class="cart-drawer__item-info">
              <h3 class="cart-drawer__item-title">
                <a class="cart-drawer__item-link" href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.product.title }}</a>
              </h3>

              {%- unless item.variant.title == 'Default Title' -%}
                <p class="cart-drawer__item-variant">{{ item.variant.title }}</p>
              {%- endunless -%}

              <p class="cart-drawer__item-price" data-cart-line-price>
                {{ item.final_line_price | money }}
              </p>

              <div class="cart-drawer__item-actions">
                <!-- Stepper de quantidade -->
                <div class="cart-drawer__qty">
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="cart-drawer__qty-button"
                    data-cart-qty-decrease
                    data-line="{{ forloop.index }}"
                    aria-label="Diminuir quantidade de {{ item.product.title | escape }}"
                  >
                    {% render 'icon', name: 'minus' %}
                  </button>

                  <label class="cart-drawer__qty-label visually-hidden" for="cart-qty-{{ forloop.index }}">
                    Quantidade de {{ item.product.title | escape }}
                  </label>
                  <input
                    class="cart-drawer__qty-input"
                    id="cart-qty-{{ forloop.index }}"
                    type="tel"
                    inputmode="numeric"
                    pattern="[0-9]*"
                    value="{{ item.quantity }}"
                    data-cart-qty-input
                    data-line="{{ forloop.index }}"
                    data-variant-id="{{ item.variant_id }}"
                    spellcheck="false"
                    autocomplete="off"
                  >

                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="cart-drawer__qty-button"
                    data-cart-qty-increase
                    data-line="{{ forloop.index }}"
                    aria-label="Aumentar quantidade de {{ item.product.title | escape }}"
                  >
                    {% render 'icon', name: 'plus' %}
                  </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Remover item -->
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="cart-drawer__item-remove"
                  data-cart-remove
                  data-line="{{ forloop.index }}"
                  data-variant-id="{{ item.variant_id }}"
                  aria-label="Remover {{ item.product.title | escape }} do carrinho"
                >
                  {% render 'icon', name: 'trash' %}
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>

      <!-- Estado vazio -->
      <div class="cart-drawer__empty" data-cart-empty {% if cart.item_count > 0 %}hidden{% endif %}>
        <span class="cart-drawer__empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          {% render 'icon', name: 'rocket' %}
        </span>
        <p class="cart-drawer__empty-title">Sua base ainda está vazia</p>
        <p class="cart-drawer__empty-text">Nenhum kit a bordo por enquanto. Bora abastecer a missão?</p>
        <a
          class="cart-drawer__empty-link"
          href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}"
          data-cart-drawer-close
        >
          Escolher meu kit
          {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow-right' %}
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Rodapé: subtotal + finalizar -->
    <footer class="cart-drawer__footer" data-cart-footer {% if cart.item_count == 0 %}hidden{% endif %}>
      <div class="cart-drawer__subtotal">
        <span class="cart-drawer__subtotal-label">Subtotal</span>
        <span class="cart-drawer__subtotal-value" data-cart-subtotal aria-live="polite">
          {{ cart.total_price | money }}
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="cart-drawer__note">Frete e descontos são calculados no checkout.</p>

      <a class="cart-drawer__checkout" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">Finalizar compra</a>

      <button type="button" class="cart-drawer__continue" data-cart-drawer-close>
        Continuar comprando
      </button>
    </footer>
  </aside>
</div>

<style>
  /* ============================================================
     CART DRAWER — carrinho lateral BRIGZ
     ------------------------------------------------------------
     Estados controlados pelo JS (classList.add/remove):
     - .is-open                   no .cart-drawer, no .cart-drawer__overlay
                                  (ou no .cart-drawer-root, que propaga p/ os dois)
     - body.cart-drawer-open      trava o scroll da página
     - .cart-drawer__item--enter  entrada animada de um item re-renderizado
     - .cart-drawer__item--leave  saída animada de um item removido
     - .is-bumping                pulso no contador e no subtotal
     ============================================================ */

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------
     Trava de scroll do body (aplicada pelo JS ao abrir o drawer)
     ------------------------------------------------------------ */
  body.cart-drawer-open {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------
     Overlay
     ------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .cart-drawer__overlay {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 9990;
    background-color: rgba(36, 18, 14, 0.5);
    backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.35s ease, visibility 0s linear 0.35s;
  }

  .cart-drawer__overlay.is-open,
  .cart-drawer-root.is-open .cart-drawer__overlay,
  body.cart-drawer-open .cart-drawer__overlay {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
    pointer-events: auto;
    transition: opacity 0.35s ease, visibility 0s linear 0s;
  }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------
     Painel
     ------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .cart-drawer {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 9991;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 440px;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: 100vh;
    height: 100dvh;
    background-color: #FFF8ED;
    border-left: 3px solid #4B291D;
    box-shadow: -10px 0 0 rgba(75, 41, 29, 0.06), -26px 0 60px rgba(36, 18, 14, 0.28);
    transform: translateX(100%);
    visibility: hidden;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.5, 0, 0.75, 0), visibility 0s linear 0.35s;
  }

  .cart-drawer.is-open,
  .cart-drawer-root.is-open .cart-drawer,
  body.cart-drawer-open .cart-drawer {
    transform: translateX(0);
    visibility: visible;
    transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), visibility 0s linear 0s;
  }

  .cart-drawer:focus {
    outline: none;
  }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------
     Cabeçalho
     ------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .cart-drawer__header {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 22px 22px 18px;
    background-color: #FFF6E8;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #4B291D;
  }

  .cart-drawer__title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-coiny);
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #4B291D;
  }

  .cart-drawer__count {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    padding: 0 8px;
    background-color: #00E6F6;
    border: 2px solid #4B291D;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family: var(--font-outfit);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #4B291D;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .cart-drawer__close {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: transparent;
    border: 2.5px solid #4B291D;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #4B291D;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .cart-drawer__close:hover {
    background-color: #4B291D;
    color: #FFF6E8;
    transform: translateY(-2px) rotate(90deg);
  }

  .cart-drawer__close svg {
    display: block;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------
     Corpo rolável
     ------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .cart-drawer__body {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-height: 0;
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }

  .cart-drawer__body::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: 6px;
  }

  .cart-drawer__body::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
    background-color: transparent;
  }

  .cart-drawer__body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background-color: rgba(75, 41, 29, 0.28);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .cart-drawer__body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
    background-color: rgba(75, 41, 29, 0.5);
  }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------
     Lista de itens
     ------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .cart-drawer__items {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px 20px 24px;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .cart-drawer__items:empty {
    display: none;
  }

  .cart-drawer__item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 13px;
    background-color: #FFFDFA;
    border: 2px solid #4B291D;
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #4B291D;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .cart-drawer__item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #4B291D;
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-image-link {
    display: block;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-image {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 88px;
    height: 88px;
    background-color: #F1E7D8;
    border: 2px solid #4B291D;
    border-radius: 16px;
    object-fit: cover;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-image--vazia {
    color: rgba(75, 41, 29, 0.45);
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-image--vazia svg {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-title {
    margin: 0 0 3px;
    font-family: var(--font-outfit);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #4B291D;
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-link {
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-link:hover {
    color: #F46700;
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-variant {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-manrope);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: rgba(75, 41, 29, 0.62);
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-price {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-outfit);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #4B291D;
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 11px;
  }

  /* Stepper de quantidade */
  .cart-drawer__qty {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2px;
    padding: 3px;
    background-color: #FFF6E8;
    border: 2px solid #4B291D;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .cart-drawer__qty-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #4B291D;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .cart-drawer__qty-button:hover {
    background-color: #4B291D;
    color: #FFF6E8;
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  .cart-drawer__qty-button:active {
    transform: scale(0.9);
  }

  .cart-drawer__qty-button svg {
    display: block;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
  }

  .cart-drawer__qty-input {
    width: 34px;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: transparent;
    border: none;
    font-family: var(--font-outfit);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1;
    text-align: center;
    color: #4B291D;
    appearance: textfield;
    -moz-appearance: textfield;
  }

  .cart-drawer__qty-input::-webkit-outer-spin-button,
  .cart-drawer__qty-input::-webkit-inner-spin-button {
    appearance: none;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cart-drawer__qty-input:focus {
    outline: none;
  }

  /* Remover item */
  .cart-drawer__item-remove {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: transparent;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: rgba(75, 41, 29, 0.5);
    cursor: pointer;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-remove:hover {
    background-color: #FFE6DA;
    border-color: #D6491F;
    color: #D6491F;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .cart-drawer__item-remove svg {
    display: block;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------
     Estado vazio
     ------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .cart-drawer__empty {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 56px 30px 40px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cart-drawer__empty[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .cart-drawer__empty-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 86px;
    height: 86px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    background-color: #F1E7D8;
    border: 3px solid #4B291D;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #4B291D;
    color: #4B291D;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    animation: cart-drawer-float 3.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .cart-drawer__empty-icon svg {
    display: block;
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
  }

  .cart-drawer__empty-title {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-coiny);
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #4B291D;
  }

  .cart-drawer__empty-text {
    max-width: 280px;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-manrope);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgba(75, 41, 29, 0.68);
  }

  .cart-drawer__empty-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    padding: 16px 26px;
    background-color: #FF8A00;
    border: 3px solid #4B291D;
    border-radius: 999px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #4B291D;
    font-family: var(--font-outfit);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.455px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #4B291D;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, background-color 0.15s ease, gap 0.15s ease;
  }

  .cart-drawer__empty-link:hover {
    background-color: #FFA733;
    box-shadow: 0 9px 0 #4B291D;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .cart-drawer__empty-link:active {
    box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #4B291D;
    transform: translateY(2px);
  }

  .cart-drawer__empty-link svg {
    display: block;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------
     Rodapé
     ------------------------------------------------------------ */
  .cart-drawer__footer {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 18px 22px calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
    background-color: #FFF6E8;
    border-top: 2px solid #4B291D;
    box-shadow: 0 -10px 24px rgba(75, 41, 29, 0.07);
  }

  .cart-drawer__footer[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .cart-drawer__subtotal {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .cart-drawer__subtotal-label {
    font-family: var(--font-outfit);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.455px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(75, 41, 29, 0.7);
  }

  .cart-drawer__subtotal-value {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-outfit);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #4B291D;
  }

  .cart-drawer__note {
    margin: 7px 0 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-manrope);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: rgba(75, 41, 29, 0.55);
  }

  .cart-drawer__checkout {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 58px;
    padding: 18px 24px;
    background-color: #2473CE;
    border: 3px solid #4B291D;
    border-radius: 999px;
    box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #4B291D;
    font-family: var(--font-outfit);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.455px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #FFFFFF;
